iv>\n</div>\n<form class=\"reservationSearch\" id=\"pg_offering\">\n    <div class=\"line vg-10--top\">\n    <div class=\"unit--1-1\">\n    <div class=\"hg-5--right\">\n    <div class=\"label-field--full\"><label class=\"bold\" for=\"pg_recordLocator\">Booking reference number</label>\n    <div class=\"label-field__field vg-5--top\"><input name=\"pg_recordLocator\" id=\"pg_recordLocator\" type=\"text\"></div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"line vg-10--top\">\n    <div class=\"unit--1-1\">\n    <div class=\"hg-5--right\">\n    <div class=\"label-field--full\"><label class=\"bold\" for=\"pg_lastName\">Last Name</label>\n    <div class=\"label-field__field vg-5--top\"><input name=\"pg_lastName\" id=\"pg_lastName\" type=\"text\"></div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"line vg-10--top\"><button class=\"btn button-primary-dark mat-button\" name=\"pg_submit\">Search</button></div>\n    <input value=\"TMfqaY0xcbbbmxKYGPjyNLEs\" name=\"pg_apiKey\" type=\"hidden\"><input value=\"en\" name=\"pg_language\" type=\"hidden\">\n</form>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div></span><!----></p><!----><!----><div class=\"link--text\"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text-button><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-space class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-spacer-component\"></div></app-jss-space><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-scripts class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></app-jss-scripts><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-space class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-spacer-component\"></div></app-jss-space><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text-button class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-title-text-button-container ng-star-inserted\"><!----><p appaddtextlimit=\"\" class=\"description ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><h2>HOW TO BUY EXTRA SEAT?</h2>\n<br>\n<ol>\n    <li>\n    <h3>Complete your data</h3>\n    <p>In “search for reservation” field, enter your reservation number and last name.</p>\n    </li>\n    <br>\n    <li>\n    <h3>Choose your seat, then the seat beside it</h3>\n    <p>Start by selecting your seat, then choose the seat next to you. You can select one or more adjacent seats based on the availability seats on your flight</p>\n    </li>\n    <br>\n    <li>\n    <h3>Enter your payment information</h3>\n    <p>Enter the details of your credit card, The amount will be deducted immediately.</p>\n    </li>\n    <br>\n    <li>\n    <h3>Check and confirm</h3>\n    <p>A confirmation e-mail will be sent to you that includes your offer details.</p>\n    </li>\n    <br>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Important Notes:</strong></p>\n<br>\n<ul>\n    <li>Please keep your confirmation email to use it as a reference in your flight.</li>\n    <li>Extra Seat service is available only for international destinations.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If there is any inquiries please contact <a href=\"mailto:plusupgrade@saudia.com?subject=Seat%2B%20Service%20Inquiry\" title=\"Seat+ Service Inquiry\">plusupgrade@saudia.com</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Related links</strong></p>\n<ul>\n    <li><a href=\"/en-SA/information/terms-and-conditions/seat-plus-terms-and-conditions\">\n    </a></li><li><a href=\"/en-SA/information/terms-and-conditions/seat-plus-terms-and-conditions\">Terms and conditions</a></li><a href=\"/en-SA/information/terms-and-conditions/seat-plus-terms-and-conditions\">\n    </a><a href=\"/en-SA/Support/HelpAndSupport/FAQs\">Frequently Asked Questions</a>\n</ul></span><!----></p><!----><!----><div class=\"link--text\"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text-button><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}